{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Howdy, y'all! Starla here!</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d64a15ab3378f80fa7ca446ad4637274.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d64a15ab3378f80fa7ca446ad4637274.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d64a15ab3378f80fa7ca446ad4637274.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Station 58! My home for the Summer! I used to come here all the time as a youngin and now I\u2019m back to bring it back to its former glory! I\u2019ve got the summer to get this place up and running again, which is a lot of work for one gal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, I\u2019m not alone! While I was working on the park I found my new best friend Shorty - say Hi Pal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--. .-. . . - .. -. --. ... / ..-. .-. .. . -. -.. ... -.-.\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shorty's trying to find a way to get home - so I said if he helped me repair the park, I can help him repair his rocket! Oh yeah, did I forget to mention he\u2019s a 25-foot tall robot? Working together we\u2019ll find a way to fix my home- and get him back to his!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/c740f7b890a4445ee0ea2d5ed1234ce9.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/c740f7b890a4445ee0ea2d5ed1234ce9.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/c740f7b890a4445ee0ea2d5ed1234ce9.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A Tale of Two Friends</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Station 58, you work to restore a national park in this Collectathon Platformer! However, this is too big a task to be done alone, so take control of duel heroes Starla and Shorty as you explore, climb, and jump to reach your goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Brave Ranger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starla's nimbleness and agility allow her to scale cracks and explore caves with ease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She excels at maneuvering through narrow spaces, stealthily approaching unsuspecting adversaries, and locating minuscule objects with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/4c07d1eb394f8e6d7e0b588279dd9d4c.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=676 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/4c07d1eb394f8e6d7e0b588279dd9d4c.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/4c07d1eb394f8e6d7e0b588279dd9d4c.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And the Wandering Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shorty, on the other hand, effortlessly lifts heavy objects and clears paths obstructed by fallen trees. Standing tall, he leverages his immense stature to propel Starla to elevated locations, swinging her across chasms with his long arms. But that's not all he can do - as you progress you\u2019ll find more and more upgrades for Shorty along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d800d29a6216bc407b81c91dc35d3b27.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d800d29a6216bc407b81c91dc35d3b27.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d800d29a6216bc407b81c91dc35d3b27.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Work together to rebuild Station 58, uncover the mystery, and get Shorty Home!</u></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757660?t=1748008598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757660?t=1748008598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/f6c228cf473bdac663e2d12b5917c7784a2a86f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748008598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/f6c228cf473bdac663e2d12b5917c7784a2a86f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748008598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Howdy, y'all! Starla here!</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d64a15ab3378f80fa7ca446ad4637274.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d64a15ab3378f80fa7ca446ad4637274.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d64a15ab3378f80fa7ca446ad4637274.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Station 58! My home for the Summer! I used to come here all the time as a youngin and now I\u2019m back to bring it back to its former glory! I\u2019ve got the summer to get this place up and running again, which is a lot of work for one gal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, I\u2019m not alone! While I was working on the park I found my new best friend Shorty - say Hi Pal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--. .-. . . - .. -. --. ... / ..-. .-. .. . -. -.. ... -.-.\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shorty's trying to find a way to get home - so I said if he helped me repair the park, I can help him repair his rocket! Oh yeah, did I forget to mention he\u2019s a 25-foot tall robot? Working together we\u2019ll find a way to fix my home- and get him back to his!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/c740f7b890a4445ee0ea2d5ed1234ce9.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/c740f7b890a4445ee0ea2d5ed1234ce9.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/c740f7b890a4445ee0ea2d5ed1234ce9.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A Tale of Two Friends</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Station 58, you work to restore a national park in this Collectathon Platformer! However, this is too big a task to be done alone, so take control of duel heroes Starla and Shorty as you explore, climb, and jump to reach your goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Brave Ranger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starla's nimbleness and agility allow her to scale cracks and explore caves with ease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She excels at maneuvering through narrow spaces, stealthily approaching unsuspecting adversaries, and locating minuscule objects with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/4c07d1eb394f8e6d7e0b588279dd9d4c.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=676 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/4c07d1eb394f8e6d7e0b588279dd9d4c.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/4c07d1eb394f8e6d7e0b588279dd9d4c.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And the Wandering Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shorty, on the other hand, effortlessly lifts heavy objects and clears paths obstructed by fallen trees. Standing tall, he leverages his immense stature to propel Starla to elevated locations, swinging her across chasms with his long arms. But that's not all he can do - as you progress you\u2019ll find more and more upgrades for Shorty along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d800d29a6216bc407b81c91dc35d3b27.poster.avif?t=1748008598\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d800d29a6216bc407b81c91dc35d3b27.webm?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/extras/d800d29a6216bc407b81c91dc35d3b27.mp4?t=1748008598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Work together to rebuild Station 58, uncover the mystery, and get Shorty Home!</u></strong></p>","developers":["Station 58"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757660/c607f4dbae14e4d9903bc91d05642b093bdf715c/header.jpg?t=1748008598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757660/1558695427/51ddeb766174a8f8bf1bfa68af5fed012c92cc1c/1750383379/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747904371","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757660/1558695427/51ddeb766174a8f8bf1bfa68af5fed012c92cc1c/1750383379/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747904371","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757660/1558695427/51ddeb766174a8f8bf1bfa68af5fed012c92cc1c/1750383379/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747904371","id":257141754,"name":"Station 58 Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141754/2c9d4c58c60a657d7157d29ca408d14f2508d909/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747904371"}],"name":"Station 58","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"